secubox-ytsas (0.1.3-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Package the admin-panel API route (ref #979): ytsas is LXC-native (no
    in-process aggregator module), so /api/v1/ytsas/ from the admin vhost
    404'd — only the companion vhost had the matching proxy_pass. Ships
    nginx/ytsas-routes.conf to /etc/nginx/secubox-routes.d/, wired through
    postinst's existing nginx -t + reload and unwired cleanly in prerm on
    remove/deconfigure (upgrade is left to dpkg's normal conffile handling).

